# animal_slopes (kenshi-7g8d, kenshi-k16.2.373.4): a viewing fixture for the outside tester's goat hop on steep terrain. The herds are the k16.2.373.2 headless rounds' herdS (steep slope, x 13590-13606, z 10640-10776, ground 1013 down to 890) and rD1 (rocky, x 13150-13166, z 9700-9876). Only the player is ever ordered. The animals are hostile (non-hostile ones just stand idle: no roaming in the sim, checked 2026-11-23): they chase the Wanderer by their own AI, which keeps them moving as long as he runs across the slope; Mercenary Plate and a katana (goat_fight) keep him up longer.
KSCEN 2
scenario title=Animals%20on%20a%20steep%20slope%20and%20rocky%20ground setup=A%20mixed%20wildlife%20herd%20(Goats%2C%20Bonedogs%2C%20Beak%20Things%2C%20Raptors%2C%20Wild%20Bulls)%20stands%20on%20a%20steep%20hillside%20of%20about%2030-39%20degrees%2C%20up%20the%20slope%20west%20of%20the%20Wanderer%3B%20a%20second%20herd%20(Skin%20Spiders%2C%20Pack%20Beasts%2C%20Skimmers%2C%20Beak%20Things%2C%20Goats)%20is%20on%20rocky%20broken%20ground%20about%20650%20u%20south-west.%20The%20animals%20are%20hostile%20and%20chase%20the%20Wanderer%2C%20in%20Mercenary%20Plate%20with%20a%20katana. look_for=Watch%20the%20Goats%20and%20the%20others%20walk%20and%20run%20over%20the%20slope%3A%20are%20the%20legs%20animated%20while%20they%20move%2C%20and%20does%20any%20body%20hop%20or%20jerk%20along%20the%20up%20axis%20on%20the%20steep%20ground%3F%20Zoom%20in%20on%20the%20Goats%20(tester%20report%202026-11-18%3A%20'goats%20moved%20up%20fine%20but%20would%20jump%20along%20the%20up-axis%20as%20they%20moved%20on%20the%20steep%20terrain').%20Fly%20the%20camera%20to%20x%2013250%2C%20z%209800%20for%20the%20rocky%20herd.%20The%20herd%20runs%20at%20the%20Wanderer%20by%20its%20own%20AI%3B%20keep%20running%20him%20(right%20click%20the%20ground)%20across%20the%20slope%20so%20they%20keep%20chasing%2C%20only%20the%20Wanderer%20is%20ever%20ordered. bead=kenshi-k16.2.373.4 metrics=player_downed_s
